          "type": "direction",
          "value": "right"
        }
      },
      "id": "63d0c212-4d0f-0455-258d-6f57bfadb07f"
    },
    {
      "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
      "args": {
        "text": [
          "Anshuman: Listen.\nHear that?\nUniversity side.",
          "A lot of them."
        ],
        "avatarId": ""
      },
      "id": "be093060-8f7a-0e68-4478-ce37c4c3aca5"
    },
    {
      "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
      "args": {
        "text": [
          "Anshuman: I'll go\nfirst and pull\nthem off.",
          "Count to sixty.\nThen run straight."
        ],
        "avatarId": ""
      },
      "id": "7291b939-3ed7-3d59-e0b4-8cd53326e381"
    },
    {
      "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
      "args": {
        "text": [
          "You: Anshuman--"
        ],
        "avatarId": ""
      },
      "id": "4a61510f-d19d-8664-45b9-52bb74ac38c0"
    },
    {
      "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
      "args": {
        "text": [
          "Anshuman: It's\nokay. I like the\ndark. Nobody",
          "notices the guy\nwho doesn't want\nto be noticed."
        ],
        "avatarId": ""
      },
      "id": "4462b95c-096c-2a3b-4c23-b02253b87f28"
    },
    {
      "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
      "args": {
        "text": [
          "Anshuman: But you\ndid. Thanks for\nthat."
        ],
        "avatarId": ""
      },
      "id": "fc2a40db-ec21-541b-0f15-672bfdd0efd4"
    },
    {
